      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This Guidance Note follows on from publication of the Sourcing Playbook and Construction Playbook. It explains how contracting authorities can reduce the risks of interruption to UK public services arising from supplier insolvency by requiring the supplier to provide resolution planning information.",
